<p>Ye beemar kehta tha kufe me badhkar, hum aal e nabi hai humein na sataao<br />
Tamaasha hamara na yu tum banao, hum aal e nabi hai humein na sataao</p>

<p>1. Na gham taaziyaano ka na bediyon ka,<br />
 hai gham maaon behno ki bepardagi ka<br />
Khule sar inhein na yahan par phirao, <br />
hum aal e nabi hai humein na sataao</p>

<p>2.Hai behna meri jiska naam hai sakina, <br />
hai pyaasi wo itni ke jalta hai seena<br />
Na tum usko paani dikhaake bahaao, <br />
hum aal e nabi hai humein na sataao</p>

<p>3. Jo naaqe se bachi giri thi zameen par, <br />
to sar mere ghazi ka rota tha kehkar<br />
Abhi karwan tum na aage badhaao,<br />
 hum aal e nabi hai humein na sataao</p>

<p>4. Phupi meri parde me rehti thi aise,<br />
 ke jisko khule sar na sooraj bhi dekhe<br />
Use aise majme me tum na phiraao,<br />
 hum aal e nabi hai humein na sataao</p>

<p>5. Yu naize se sar jo chacha ka hai girta, <br />
sabab iska hai meri phupiyo ka parda<br />
Khula sar phupi ka na unko dikhaao,<br />
 hum aal e nabi hai humein na sataao</p>

<p>6. Tha abid pe sabse kadha waqt us jaa, <br />
ke darbar me jab gayi&rsquo;n bint e zehra<br />
Ye kehta tha hakim, ta-arruf karao,<br />
 hum aal e nabi hai humein na sataao</p>

<p>7. Karo asghari milke syed ka matam,<br />
 awaalim me barpa hai syed ka maatam<br />
Ye rudaad <b>Mirza</b> sabhi ko sunaao,<br />
 hum aal e nabi hai humein na sataao</p>

